    date: "July 24, 2026",
    excerpt: "Congratulations to three other RUPPers who have successfully landed and participated in the 2026 NUS Enterprise Summer Programmed in Entrepreneurship hosted by the National University of Singapore (NUS) in Singapore 🇸🇬✨ The programme offers participants the opportunity to immerse themselves in the new venture creation process, gain insight into the start-up ecosystems in Singapore and the Southeast Asian region, and build connections with peers from the region and beyond. Our warmest regards and congratulations to our students who are currently participating in the programme: → Ms. Lim Kimyi, a third-year student in the Department of International Business Management → Ms. Sean Sophaltheany, a third-year student in the Department of English → Ms. Krin Soktheany, a second-year student in the Department of Automation and Supply Chain Systems Engineering We sincerely hope that your time in Singapore not only deepens your understanding of Entrepreneurship in the information age but also broadens your perspectives on development in Cambodia. We are excited to see how this experience will inspire and empower you. 🎊🎉",
